# =============================================================================
# CONFIGURATION NOTES
# =============================================================================

# 1. TRAILING SLASH IN PROXY_PASS
#    proxy_pass http://localhost:8000/;  <- This trailing slash is CRITICAL
#    It strips the /manage prefix before forwarding to the app
#    
#    Without trailing slash: nginx forwards /manage/login to app
#    With trailing slash:    nginx forwards /login to app (correct)

# 2. ROOT_PATH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE
#    Must match the nginx location:
#    - nginx: location /manage/
#    - docker: ROOT_PATH=/manage
#    
#    Mismatch will cause 404s or wrong redirects

# 3. TESTING CONFIGURATION
#    sudo nginx -t                    # Test syntax
#    sudo systemctl reload nginx      # Reload config
#    curl http://localhost/manage/    # Test endpoint

# 4. DOCKER CONTAINER
#    Ensure container is running and accessible:
#    docker-compose ps                # Check status
#    curl http://localhost:8000/      # Test direct access
#    docker-compose logs -f           # Check logs

# 5. COMMON ISSUES
#    - 404 errors: Check trailing slash in proxy_pass
#    - Wrong redirects: Check ROOT_PATH matches nginx location
#    - CSS not loading: Verify nginx forwards all paths under /manage/
#    - CSRF errors: Ensure proxy headers are set correctly
